@startuml
left to right direction

actor "ML Service" as MLService
actor "ML Engineer" as Engineer
actor "GPU Cluster" as GPU

rectangle "Обработка медицинских изображений (ResNet-50)" {
  (Получить изображение из очереди) as GetImage
  (Загрузить из S3) as LoadS3
  (Декодирование через OpenCV) as Decode
  (Изменение размера до 224x224) as Resize
  (Нормализация ImageNet) as Normalize
  (Конвертация в тензор float32) as ToTensor
  (Классификация через ResNet-50) as Classify
  (Генерация Grad-CAM heatmap) as GradCAM
  (Кэширование результатов Redis) as Cache
  (Сохранение в PostgreSQL) as SaveDB
  (Обновление модели) as UpdateModel
  (Мониторинг точности ≥95%) as Monitor
}

MLService --> GetImage
GetImage ..> LoadS3: <<include>>
LoadS3 ..> Decode: <<include>>
Decode ..> Resize: <<include>>
Resize ..> Normalize: <<include>>
Normalize ..> ToTensor: <<include>>

ToTensor ..> Classify: <<include>>
Classify ..> GradCAM: <<include>>

Classify ..> Cache: <<include>>
Classify ..> SaveDB: <<include>>

Classify <.. Monitor: <<extend>>

Engineer --> UpdateModel
Engineer --> Monitor

GPU <.. Classify: uses

@enduml